cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use groundgate or its benchmark, please cite it as below.
title: "groundgate: deterministic admission for LLM-extracted facts"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mohan Raj
    alias: mohanraj00
version: 0.5.1
date-released: 2026-10-07
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/mohanraj00/groundgate
abstract: >-
  groundgate checks facts an LLM extracted from a document: that the value is in the cited text,
  with the right unit, and that nothing nearby changes its meaning. Each fact is admitted, sent
  to a person, or rejected with a stable reason code, and every run writes a receipt that anyone
  can re-derive.
keywords:
  - llm
  - information extraction
  - grounding
  - verification
  - langextract
